{"title":"소꿉친구의 S급 파티에서 추방된 성수사. 만능 지원마법과 동료를 늘려 최강으로! [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bwJtUp/hAJmyXI42p/fFwXpGwwjktKMl93Nw66D0&filename=th3","synopsis":"무능한 줄 알았는데 사실은 엄청 유능하다고?!\n짐꾼으로 취급받던 최강 성수사의\n대역전 판타지, 개막!\n\n환상의 마수 ‘성수’를 길들일 수 있는\n희귀한 직업 성수사, 그 성수사임에도 불구하고\n아무리 지나도 성수를 길들이지 못해\n오랜 세월 성공을 목표로 함께해온 소꿉친구 파티에서\n버림받은 주인공 로크.\n그러나 기적인지 우연인지\n어떤 사건을 계기로 전설의 성수 펜리르를\n길들이는데 성공하는데―?!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":202,"change":{"type":"down","amount":62}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":243,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":161,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":219,"change":{"type":"down","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":263,"change":{"type":"down","amount":44}},{"date":"2026-09-21","rank":102,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-22","rank":113,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-09-23","rank":166,"change":{"type":"down","amount":53}},{"date":"2026-09-24","rank":216,"change":{"type":"down","amount":50}},{"date":"2026-10-12","rank":129,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-13","rank":210,"change":{"type":"down","amount":81}},{"date":"2026-10-14","rank":255,"change":{"type":"down","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-10-15","rank":173,"change":{"type":"up","amount":82}},{"date":"2026-10-16","rank":247,"change":{"type":"down","amount":74}},{"date":"2026-10-17","rank":289,"change":{"type":"down","amount":42}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":247,"change":{"type":"down","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":248,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":251,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":251,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":252,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":244,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":296,"